<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Yelpcamp</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link href="https://cdn.maptiler.com/maptiler-sdk-js/v2.0.1/maptiler-sdk.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/home.css">

</head>



<body class="d-flex text-center text-white bg-dark">
    <div class="cover-container d-flex w-100 h-100 p-3 mx-auto flex-column">
        <header class="mb-auto">
            <div>
                <h3 class="float-md-left mb-0">YelpCamp</h3>

                <nav class="nav nav-masthead justify-content-center float-md-right">
                    <a class="nav-link active" aria-current="page" href="#">Home</a>
                    <a class="nav-link" href="/campgrounds">Campgrounds</a>
                    <% if(!currentUser){ %>
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/login">Login</a>
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/register">Register</a>
                        <% } else {%>
                            <a class="nav-link" href="/logout">Logout</a>
                            <% } %>
                </nav>
            </div>
        </header>
        <main class="px-3">
            <h1>Yelpcamp</h1>
            <p class="lead">
                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Distinctio quos ipsa aspernatur, quo iusto
                dolorum quibusdam perspiciatis temporibus, soluta minus delectus odio neque modi fugit ex eius
                cupiditate rerum beatae!
            </p>
            <a href="/campgrounds" class="btn btn-lg btn-secondary font-weight-bold text-white bg-white">View
                Campgrounds</a>
        </main>
        <footter class="mg-auto text-white-50">
            <p>
                &copy 2020 YelpCamp
            </p>
        </footter>
    </div>
</body>


<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>


</body>

</html>